msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592087:0:22"
msgid "You will now be invited to a Triple Triad match. Select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin the game."
msgstr "Сейчас вам предложат сыграть в «Тройную триаду». Выберите <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Вызов»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, чтобы начать партию."

#. ja: ……あら、まだデッキが組めていないみたいですね。<br>一度、「所持品」を確認してみてはいかがでしょう！
#. de: Hast du dir noch kein Deck zu<shy>sammen<shy>gestellt? Sag nicht, dass du deine Karten einfach so in deine Taschen gestopft hast!
#. fr: Vous n'avez toujours pas préparé votre jeu<nbsp>? N'hésitez pas à jeter un œil dans votre inventaire<nbsp>!
#. column 21: Any new cards you obtain will be stored in your inventory. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Use</ui-edge-color></ui-color> a card to add it to your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card List</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, which can be viewed from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> options under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Character</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu.
#. column 22: Next, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card Decks</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, also found under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, to build a five-card deck from your registered cards.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592088:0:20"
msgid "...Hmm, have you not built a deck, yet? Don't tell me you simply stuffed those cards into the bottom of your bag and forgot about them!"
msgstr "...Хм, вы ещё не собрали колоду? Только не говорите, что просто сунули карты на дно сумки и забыли о них!"

#. ja: 入手したカードは、「所持品」の中で保管されます。<br>使用することで、メインコマンドの「ゴールドソーサー」の<br>項目にある「CARD LIST」に登録されます。
#. de: Neue Karten landen zuerst in deinem Inventar. Benutze sie, um sie deiner Kartenliste hinzuzufügen. Die Liste aller Karten, die dir zur Verfügung stehen, findest du im Hauptmenü unter „Charakter“ → „Gold Saucer“ → „Karten“.
#. fr: Utilisez les cartes placées dans votre inventaire pour les voir apparaître dans la rubrique “Cartes” de la fenêtre <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, accessible à partir de la rubrique <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Personnage</ui-edge-color></ui-color> du menu principal.
#. column 20: ...Hmm, have you not built a deck, yet? Don't tell me you simply stuffed those cards into the bottom of your bag and forgot about them!
#. column 22: Next, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card Decks</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, also found under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, to build a five-card deck from your registered cards.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592088:0:21"
msgid "Any new cards you obtain will be stored in your inventory. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Use</ui-edge-color></ui-color> a card to add it to your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card List</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, which can be viewed from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> options under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Character</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu."
msgstr "Все новые карты попадают в инвентарь. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Используйте</ui-edge-color></ui-color> карту, чтобы добавить её в <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>список карт</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Посмотреть его можно в разделе <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Золотое Яблоко</ui-edge-color></ui-color> меню <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Персонаж</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: つづいて、同じ「ゴールドソーサー」の項目にある、<br>「CARD DECK」を選択し、登録したカードの中から、<br>5枚を選ぶことで、「デッキ」を組むことができます。
#. de: Im Gold Saucer-Menü findest du das Untermenü „Decks“ - dort kannst du dir ein Deck mit den Karten zu<shy>sammen<shy>stellen, die du im Spiel benutzen möchtest.
#. fr: Sélectionnez ensuite l'option “Jeux” pour constituer ou modifier un jeu de cinq cartes.
#. column 20: ...Hmm, have you not built a deck, yet? Don't tell me you simply stuffed those cards into the bottom of your bag and forgot about them!
#. column 21: Any new cards you obtain will be stored in your inventory. <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Use</ui-edge-color></ui-color> a card to add it to your <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card List</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, which can be viewed from the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color> options under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Character</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu.
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592088:0:22"
msgid "Next, select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Card Decks</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, also found under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gold Saucer</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, to build a five-card deck from your registered cards."
msgstr "Затем выберите пункт <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Колоды»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> в разделе <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Золотое Яблоко»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> и соберите колоду из пяти карт, добавленных в список."

#. ja: あらら、勝っちゃいました……。<br>でも、基本的なルールの確認はできましたね！<br>ルールを覚えられたら、色んな人と対戦してみましょう！
#. de: Ich habe gewonnen. Aber das sollte dich nicht beirren. Verlieren gehört zum Spiel und zum Lernprozess.
#. fr: J'ai gagné, mais vous apprendrez vite<nbsp>! N'hésitez pas à défier les adeptes de Triple Triade qui croiseront votre route. C'est en forgeant qu'on devient forgeron...
#. column 21: The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592089:0:20"
msgid "Ah, I seem to have beaten you...<br>Well, defeat is all part of the experience! And now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!"
msgstr "Ах, кажется, я вас победил...<br>Что ж, проигрыш — тоже часть опыта! Теперь вы знаете правила, так что отправляйтесь искать игроков в «Тройную триаду» здесь, в Золотом Яблоке, и по всему миру!"

#. ja: エオルゼアには、「トリプルトライアド」の対戦を<br>待ち望んでいる人が、様々な場所にいます。<br>都合さえ合えば、気軽に対戦を受けてくれるでしょう！
#. de: Fordere doch mal einen der Spieler an den Kartentischen heraus. Oder einen anderen Abenteurer! Triple Triad wird immer beliebter und inzwischen überall in Eorzea gespielt.
#. fr: Vous trouverez des adversaires dans tout Éorzéa. Tentez votre chance si les règles qu'ils proposent vous conviennent<nbsp>!
#. column 20: Ah, I seem to have beaten you...<br>Well, defeat is all part of the experience! And now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592089:0:21"
msgid "The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!"
msgstr "Эта игра обрела немало поклонников, и вы наверняка найдёте желающих сыграть в самых разных уголках Эорзеи!"

#. ja: 冒険者同士だけではなく、キャラクターとも対戦が可能です。<br>対戦可能なキャラクターの頭上には、アイコンが出るので、<br>それを目印に、対戦を申し込んでみましょう。
#. de: Sogar Schankwirte und Leiter der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilden, um nur einige zu nennen, lassen sich nun auf eine Partie mit dir ein. Halte deine Augen offen, dann wirst du sie schon finden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez défier les autres aventuriers ou tout PNJ avec un icone en forme de carte au-dessus de la tête.
#. column 20: Ah, I seem to have beaten you...<br>Well, defeat is all part of the experience! And now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!
#. column 21: The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592089:0:22"
msgid "In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match."
msgstr "Сразиться в «Тройную триаду» можно не только с другими искателями приключений, но и с NPC. Над их <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>именем</ui-edge-color></ui-color> отображается особый значок в виде карты. Поговорите с ними и выберите <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Вызов»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, чтобы начать партию."

#. ja: おお～、お見事でした！<br>どうやら、基本的なルールはバッチリですね！<br>ルールを覚えられたら、色んな人と対戦してみましょう！
#. de: Gut gemacht! Du hast das Prinzip verstanden.
#. fr: Vous vous êtes débrouillé<if $gn4>e</if> comme un<if $gn4>e</if> chef<nbsp>! Vous maîtrisez les règles, il ne vous reste plus qu'à aller défier tous les malheureux que vous croiserez.
#. column 21: The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592090:0:20"
msgid "Oh, well done! Now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!"
msgstr "О, отлично! Теперь вы знаете правила, так что отправляйтесь искать игроков в «Тройную триаду» здесь, в Золотом Яблоке, и по всему миру!"

#. ja: エオルゼアには、「トリプルトライアド」の対戦を<br>待ち望んでいる人が、様々な場所にいます。<br>都合さえ合えば、気軽に対戦を受けてくれるでしょう！
#. de: Fordere doch mal einen der Spieler an den Kartentischen heraus. Oder einen anderen Abenteurer! Triple Triad wird immer beliebter und inzwischen überall in Eorzea gespielt.
#. fr: Vous trouverez des adversaires dans tout Éorzéa. Tentez votre chance si les règles qu'ils proposent vous conviennent<nbsp>!
#. column 20: Oh, well done! Now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592090:0:21"
msgid "The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!"
msgstr "Эта игра обрела немало поклонников, и вы наверняка найдёте желающих сыграть в самых разных уголках Эорзеи!"

#. ja: 冒険者同士だけではなく、キャラクターとも対戦が可能です。<br>対戦可能なキャラクターの頭上には、アイコンが出るので、<br>それを目印に、対戦を申し込んでみましょう。
#. de: Sogar Schankwirte und Leiter der Aben<shy>teurer<shy>gilden, um nur einige zu nennen, lassen sich nun auf eine Partie mit dir ein. Halte deine Augen offen, dann wirst du sie schon finden.
#. fr: Vous pouvez défier les autres aventuriers ou tout PNJ avec un icone en forme de carte au-dessus de la tête.
#. column 20: Oh, well done! Now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!
#. column 21: The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592090:0:22"
msgid "In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match."
msgstr "Сразиться в «Тройную триаду» можно не только с другими искателями приключений, но и с NPC. Над их <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>именем</ui-edge-color></ui-color> отображается особый значок в виде карты. Поговорите с ними и выберите <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Вызов»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, чтобы начать партию."

#. ja: 引き分けのときは、互いの健闘を讃えあいましょう！<br>さて、基本的なルールの確認はできましたね！<br>ルールを覚えられたら、色んな人と対戦してみましょう！
#. de: Gleichstand - wir hatten beide die gleiche Anzahl von Karten. Das heißt, die Partie endet unentschieden.
#. fr: Égalité<nbsp>! Voilà la preuve que deux adversaires de talent se sont rencontrés et que même la chance n'a pas réussi à les départager<nbsp>! Une chose est sûre, vous maîtrisez les règles et il ne vous reste plus qu'à aller défier ceux qui croiseront votre route<nbsp>!
#. column 21: The game has gained an avid following, and you're sure to find willing participants in various locales across Eorzea!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
msgctxt "DefaultTalk:592091:0:20"
msgid "As we each have an equal number of cards under our control, the match has ended in a draw! Well fought! Now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!"
msgstr "У нас с вами оказалось поровну карт, так что партия закончилась вничью! Отлично сыграно! Теперь вы знаете правила, так что отправляйтесь искать игроков в «Тройную триаду» здесь, в Золотом Яблоке, и по всему миру!"

#. ja: エオルゼアには、「トリプルトライアド」の対戦を<br>待ち望んでいる人が、様々な場所にいます。<br>都合さえ合えば、気軽に対戦を受けてくれるでしょう！
#. de: Fordere doch mal einen der Spieler an den Kartentischen heraus. Oder einen anderen Abenteurer! Triple Triad wird immer beliebter und inzwischen überall in Eorzea gespielt.
#. fr: Vous trouverez des adversaires dans tout Éorzéa. Tentez votre chance si les règles qu'ils proposent vous conviennent<nbsp>!
#. column 20: As we each have an equal number of cards under our control, the match has ended in a draw! Well fought! Now that you have an understanding of the rules, it's time for you to go forth and seek out the many Triple Triad players found here in the Gold Saucer...and the world beyond!
#. column 22: In addition to challenging your fellow adventurers, you can also play Triple Triad matches against NPCs who are marked with a special card-shaped icon above their <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>display name</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Simply speak with the NPC and select <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Challenge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> to begin a match.
